{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>丹麥男演員Nikolaj Coster-Waldau憑HBO神劇《權力遊戲》（Game of Thrones）飾演「Jaime Lannister」一角而為人熟悉，近日他以聯合國開發計劃署（UNDP）親善大使身份，探訪烏克蘭首都基輔。期間遇上空襲威脅，Nikolaj被逼與當地居民一起躲進地鐵站避難過夜。</p><figure><img alt=\"丹麥男演員Nikolaj Coster-Waldau憑HBO神劇《權力遊戲》（Game of Thrones）飾演「Jaime Lannister」一角而為人熟悉。（《權力遊戲》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194318856022134784356241.jpeg/g8btcGxGy0_HR7UYLxgsifm-pcpoTWnhVLyP9FS8j_Q\"/><figcaption>丹麥男演員Nikolaj Coster-Waldau憑HBO神劇《權力遊戲》（Game of Thrones）飾演「Jaime Lannister」一角而為人熟悉。（《權力遊戲》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民在基輔街頭捕獲Nikolaj Coster-Waldau。（IG/@nikolajwilliamcw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194322913805996032765238.png/Ukf0AACavRmev7IYXKfUCxOJQnRFuE1-_KsevfyrHr0\"/><figcaption>有網民在基輔街頭捕獲Nikolaj Coster-Waldau。（IG/@nikolajwilliamcw）</figcaption></figure><p>Nikolaj Coster-Waldau遇空襲躲地鐵站過夜</p><p>綜合外媒報道，上周三Nikolaj Coster-Waldau探訪基輔時，突然遇上空襲警報，與當地居民一起躲進地鐵站。從照片可見，孭住背囊的他坐在地鐵站內，並在摺床上過夜。有當地粉絲見到Nikolaj，立即上前自拍合照。其後Nikolaj在IG報平安，表示：「人們不會忘記有一個國家需要幫助」。Nikolaj自2016年起成為UNDP親善大使，一向極力支持氣候行動和性別平等議題。</p><figure><img alt=\"Nikolaj Coster-Waldau遇空襲警報。（Reuters）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194322911087955968925614.png/SjzGTE3McP22j-6imdAKAlxkB0JP9uEEb6By9W-gcvU\"/><figcaption>Nikolaj Coster-Waldau遇空襲警報。（Reuters）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與當地居民躲地鐵站過夜。（Reuters）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194322908143423488984350.png/rV9isRGGWmSi_l705GFEy1dcqQ9fPCOrUIwBGVCMARk\"/><figcaption>與當地居民躲地鐵站過夜。（Reuters）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:02:47.494201+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":581,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:45:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:01.103854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:01.103854+00:00","content_hash":"061195a43ac711b78185b505108c75ab0fb633c4657e7a5f6f006712ad1d93b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}